b0\u1ee1i g\u00e0 v\u00e0 c\u1ea1nh gi\u00e0y, t\u0103ng t\u00ednh nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n.<\/li><li>Thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf distressed (hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng m\u00f2n c\u0169) mang l\u1ea1i v\u1ebb ngo\u00e0i c\u00e1 t\u00ednh.<\/li><\/ul><\/li><li><strong>\u0110i\u1ec3m n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt<\/strong>: L\u00e0 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng c\u1ee7a th\u1eddi trang xa x\u1ec9 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p streetwear, \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e1c ng\u00f4i sao nh\u01b0 Kanye West v\u00e0 Justin Bieber \u01b0a chu\u1ed9ng. Triple S \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u1ecbnh h\u00ecnh l\u1ea1i kh\u00e1i ni\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 gi\u00e0y \"x\u1ea5u l\u1ea1\" (ugly sneaker).<\/li><li><strong>L\u00fd do b\u00e1n ch\u1ea1y<\/strong>: S\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9c \u0111\u00e1o, khan hi\u1ebfm c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n, v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u1ea1o tuy\u00ean ng\u00f4n th\u1eddi trang m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd.<\/li><\/ul>","status":"active","category_id":1,"brand_id":6,"created_at":"2025-04-11T09:20:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T10:15:41.000000Z","deleted_at":null}}},{"id":9,"order_id":7,"product_detail_id":22,"price":"990000.00","quantity":2,"total_price":"1980000.00","created_at":"2025-04-11T18:30:39.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T18:30:39.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"product_detail":{"id":22,"image":"[\"variant_images\\\/Lod3G3IOqmwK5edII22XJoOF3yVicig7GWqp2o5h.png\"]","product_id":6,"size_id":4,"color_id":4,"quantity":8,"default_price":"1200000.00","discount_price":"990000.00","status":"active","created_at":"2025-04-11T09:12:50.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-04-11T18:30:39.000000Z","deleted_at":null,"product":{"id":6,"name":"New Balance 550","image":"tmp_product_images\/H6S69yajbUlgwsJPz7cs6M6H8Q6c56fpnVABtIuj.png","price":"1200000.00","description":"<ul><li><strong>M\u00f4 t\u1ea3<\/strong>: Ra m\u1eaft l\u1ea1i v\u00e0o n\u0103m 2020, New Balance 550 c\u00f3 thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf retro v\u1edbi upper da v\u00e0 da l\u1ed9n, logo \"N\" n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt, v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ebf cao su ch\u1eafc ch